# === macOS duplicate files ===
# Finder and iCloud/Dropbox-style sync create "<name> 2.ext" copies. Committing
# one of these under supabase/migrations applies that migration twice and the
# run dies on `type ... already exists`; it happened once and cost a CI cycle to
# find. Ignored everywhere because a duplicate source file is never intended.
* 2.*
* 3.*
